outcome_schema.description:
JSON Schema (`"type": "object"`, up to 16 KiB) for the business
outcome the agent reports. The agent receives it with its context;
reports that do not match it are rejected.

provider_id.description:
Optional IdP connection to bind this token to. When set, SCIM group
pushes resolve roles through that connection's group→role mappings;
when omitted the token does membership-only SCIM (auto add/remove).

waived_credits.description:
Credits forgiven on this run (`on_us` discounts). 0 for normal runs;
when > 0 the UI shows the "on us" chip. `cost_credits +
waived_credits` is the write-time pin (gross credits).

